sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(232,245,245) Tenant Namespace (team-a)
        participant Client as Agent Pod<br/>(SA: ogx-developer)
    end

    box rgb(245,245,240) OpenShift Infra
        participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>(TLS Termination)
    end

    box rgb(240,235,248) OGX Server Pod
        participant AuthN as AuthN Middleware<br/>(JWT Validation)
        participant RouteZ as Route Policy<br/>(RBAC)
        participant API as API Handler<br/>(/v1/responses)
        participant ABAC as AuthorizedSqlStore<br/>(ABAC)
    end

    box rgb(240,240,240) Storage
        participant DB as PostgreSQL
    end

    Client->>Route: POST /v1/responses<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
    Route->>AuthN: Forward (TLS terminated)

    Note over AuthN: Validate JWT signature<br/>via JWKS endpoint
    AuthN->>AuthN: Extract principal + attributes<br/>sub: "system:sa:team-a:dev"<br/>namespaces: ["team-a"]

    AuthN->>RouteZ: Authenticated request
    Note over RouteZ: Check route_policy rules<br/>"Can this role call /v1/responses?"
    RouteZ-->>Client: 403 if route denied

    RouteZ->>API: Authorized request
    API->>ABAC: store_response(data)

    Note over ABAC: Stamp with owner:<br/>owner_principal = "system:sa:team-a:dev"<br/>access_attributes = {"namespaces":["team-a"]}

    ABAC->>DB: INSERT with owner columns

    DB-->>ABAC: OK
    ABAC-->>API: Stored
    API-->>Client: 200 Response created

    rect rgb(245, 245, 255)
    Note over Client,DB: Later: List responses
    Client->>Route: GET /v1/responses<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
    Route->>AuthN: Forward
    AuthN->>RouteZ: Authenticated
    RouteZ->>API: Authorized
    API->>ABAC: fetch_all(responses)

    Note over ABAC: SQL WHERE clause:<br/>owner_principal = 'system:sa:team-a:dev'<br/>OR access_attributes match

    ABAC->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE owner filter
    DB-->>ABAC: Only team-a's rows
    ABAC-->>API: Filtered results
    API-->>Client: 200 [only your responses]
    end
